{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19103530","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19103530","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1910353001:1":{"text":"……波涛长者。","source_cn":"……波涛长者。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x4565671DC9F5D4A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910353002:1":{"text":"咱的祖先以前不小心掉下过海，失去意识前的一瞬间，看到了...","source_cn":"咱的祖先以前不小心掉下过海，失去意识前的一瞬间，看到了...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910353003:0":{"text":"卡什澜信仰它，不止是因为它很强大。","source_cn":"卡什澜信仰它，不止是因为它很强大。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x97DC69BCB3870557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910353004:1":{"text":"而是因为它那么强大，还愿意让善良的生灵在身上安家，是庇...","source_cn":"而是因为它那么强大，还愿意让善良的生灵在身上安家，是庇...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910353005:1":{"text":"现在看，是咱想多了。它完全不在意你们的死活！","source_cn":"现在看，是咱想多了。它完全不在意你们的死活！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x0BAB469B70C4917F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status"